{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NEXO is a side-view, 2-player cooperative shooting game where you must defeat a powerful boss within a limited time! Team up with a friend to take down mighty enemies! Each character wields a weapon with both a normal attack and a special attack, and these two types of attacks can interact with each other. Work together to unleash even more powerful combined attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose your character based on their unique traits!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each of the sisters, Ria and Nia, uses a weapon with distinct characteristics. Select the character that best matches your play style! When two players team up and attack in sync, they can unleash even more powerful attacks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426770/extras/2024_\uc11c\uc11c\ub2f4_Screenshot0.png?t=1744976296\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Stop the boss\u2019s invasion of Earth!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An alien lifeform has appeared on Earth!! The boss will use a variety of attacks to threaten the players. Use nearby platforms and shields to evade the boss\u2019s attacks as much as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426770/extras/2024_\uc11c\uc11c\ub2f4_Screenshot6.png?t=1744976296\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Counter the boss\u2019s powerful attacks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At specific moments, the boss will unleash terrifying attacks! Cooperate to counter these powerful moves and turn the tide of battle in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426770/extras/2024_\uc11c\uc11c\ub2f4_Screenshot7.png?t=1744976296\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3426770?t=174497629